00:53:02,000 --> 00:53:03,600
Unni.

523
00:53:06,200 --> 00:53:11,200
You know I have a contest next week, right?

524
00:53:12,530 --> 00:53:15,310
How would I know that?

525
00:53:19,000 --> 00:53:21,400
I guess I didn't tell you.

526
00:53:22,600 --> 00:53:25,800
Do you know I dance?

527
00:53:27,800 --> 00:53:35,200
You know... mom and dad said they have somewhere to go,

528
00:53:35,200 --> 00:53:37,700
so they said they might not be able to come and watch me.

529
00:53:38,400 --> 00:53:43,700
Uncle is busy too.

530
00:53:48,800 --> 00:53:54,800
Unni. Can you come watch me?

531
00:53:54,800 --> 00:53:56,600
No.

532
00:54:04,400 --> 00:54:07,800
Still... it's okay.

533
00:54:07,800 --> 00:54:10,300
Dong Soo said he'll come.

534
00:54:11,000 --> 00:54:17,400
Unni. Dong Soo has suddenly been friendly to me lately.

535
00:54:17,400 --> 00:54:20,000
He must have had a change of heart.

536
00:54:20,000 --> 00:54:24,000
I told him to come to the contest, and he asked who was coming.

537
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:26,600
So I said "I don't know".

538
00:54:26,600 --> 00:54:29,800
But anyway, he said he will be going.

539
00:54:29,800 --> 00:54:31,600
It worked out well, didn't it?

540
00:54:33,200 --> 00:54:37,200
I know what that sigh means.

541
00:54:39,600 --> 00:54:41,900
That you're getting tired of me. Right?

542
00:54:43,400 --> 00:54:45,400
I know but...

543
00:54:46,200 --> 00:54:49,200
No matter how much I think about it,

544
00:54:49,200 --> 00:54:52,800
I don't know what you mean when you said that I'm fooling myself.

545
00:54:53,800 --> 00:54:57,200
I really like you.

546
00:54:57,200 --> 00:55:00,300
But you hate me, don't you?

547
00:55:00,300 --> 00:55:05,000
I know. I know, but you can just continue to hate me then.

548
00:55:05,000 --> 00:55:08,000
I'll continue to like you.

549
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:11,600
Even if you hate me, I won't tell you to like me.

550
00:55:11,600 --> 00:55:15,800
So don't tell me to force myself to hate you.

551
00:55:16,920 --> 00:55:18,940
I...

552
00:55:19,800 --> 00:55:23,000
can do whatever makes you happy.

553
00:55:23,800 --> 00:55:26,500
Except hate you.

554
00:55:28,400 --> 00:55:31,900
You must hate to death how I keep blabbing on like this, don't you?

555
00:55:33,600 --> 00:55:37,300
I know. I'm sorry.

556
00:55:45,800 --> 00:55:47,600
It's Dong Soo.

557
00:55:48,300 --> 00:55:50,100
Dong Soo!

558
00:55:51,800 --> 00:55:58,800
♫ where you can't hold me again ♫

559
00:55:58,800 --> 00:56:04,400
♫ I ask about this path again ♫

560
00:56:04,400 --> 00:56:06,200
♫ Even if I want to see you ♫

561
00:56:06,200 --> 00:56:08,000
Eun Jo.

562
00:56:08,000 --> 00:56:13,200
♫ Even if I want to hug you ♫

563
00:56:13,200 --> 00:56:17,400
♫ While looking at heaven, I pray. ♫

564
00:56:17,400 --> 00:56:19,200
Eun Jo.

565
00:56:19,200 --> 00:56:22,800
♫ It must be you ♫

566
00:56:22,800 --> 00:56:26,600
♫ I can't be without you ♫

567
00:56:26,600 --> 00:56:37,200
♫ Like this, for another day, month, and year ♫

568
00:56:37,200 --> 00:56:41,000
♫ It's okay, even if I'm hurt; it's okay, even if my heart breaks ♫

569
00:56:41,000 --> 00:56:47,200
♫ Still, because I only love you ♫

570
00:56:49,200 --> 00:56:51,000
♫ Because I only love you ♫

571
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:51,800
Oppa.

572
00:56:51,800 --> 00:56:52,800
Oh, you're here?

573
00:56:52,800 --> 00:56:54,600
This is for you.

574
00:56:54,600 --> 00:56:57,000
Oh, thank you. You came all the way here.

575
00:57:45,600 --> 00:57:47,600
You're back?

576
00:57:51,400 --> 00:57:54,400
Oh my gosh! Did I pinch you? Did I pinch you?

577
00:57:55,200 --> 00:57:59,200
No, no. It''s okay. It's okay.

578
00:57:59,200 --> 00:58:03,800
I'm sorry. I'll be careful.

579
00:58:03,800 --> 00:58:04,800
Okay.

580
00:58:04,800 --> 00:58:06,200
I'm sorry.

581
00:58:31,500 --> 00:58:33,300
Surprise!

582
00:58:34,600 --> 00:58:36,300
What is this?

583
00:58:38,220 --> 00:58:41,990
The wallpaper in your room will be finished tomorrow.

584
00:58:42,000 --> 00:58:47,600
Today is the last day we'll be sleeping in the same room together, so I threw a farewell party for you.

585
00:58:47,600 --> 00:58:49,500
Sit down, Unni.

586
00:58:50,220 --> 00:58:53,220
Ah. I should call Oppa Gi Hoon too.

587
00:58:54,800 --> 00:58:56,200
Hold on a minute, Unni.

588
00:58:56,200 --> 00:58:58,000
You...

589
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:06,200
If you like me so much, can you give me anything I ask for?

590
00:59:08,200 --> 00:59:11,700
What do you want? Just tell me!

591
00:59:11,700 --> 00:59:14,400
I can pick out all the stars and the moon for you too!

592
00:59:14,400 --> 00:59:18,500
No matter what I take. Can you endure it all?

593
00:59:19,200 --> 00:59:24,600
No matter what you take. I can endure it.

594
00:59:24,600 --> 00:59:27,000
No matter what I take...

595
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:30,200
Can you like me to the very end?

596
00:59:30,200 --> 00:59:32,400
I can.

597
00:59:33,100 --> 00:59:34,800
Really?

598
00:59:34,800 --> 00:59:37,300
I'm saying it's for real.

599
00:59:50,300 --> 00:59:54,600
I don't know why I wanted to play that kind of a joke.

600
00:59:54,600 --> 00:59:59,200
I was just angry somehow...

601
00:59:59,200 --> 01:00:03,000
I can't pick out why in particular.

602
01:00:15,100 --> 01:00:17,400
Really.

603
01:00:17,400 --> 01:00:20,500
Dong Soo gave this to me, saying he wanted to date me.

604
01:00:22,200 --> 01:00:26,400
Why? Didn't you say I can take anything?

605
01:00:31,000 --> 01:00:33,400
As i guessed. You can't, huh?

606
01:00:34,200 --> 01:00:37,000
That you'll like me.

607
01:00:37,000 --> 01:00:40,100
You're fooling yourself.

608
01:00:42,800 --> 01:00:44,900
Do you get it now?

609
01:00:48,190 --> 01:00:53,000
Did Dong Soo really give this to you?

610
01:00:54,000 --> 01:00:56,100
I told you he did.

611
01:00:59,000 --> 01:01:02,800
Can I look at the card?

612
01:01:02,800 --> 01:01:04,800
Card?
Card?

613
01:01:04,800 --> 01:01:06,400
Card?

614
01:01:07,400 --> 01:01:10,820
This is a big problem. That was in there.

615
01:01:13,400 --> 01:01:16,700
No. Not the card.

616
01:01:41,800 --> 01:01:45,200
Song Eun Jo! I like you. I want to date you. Let's date! I'll be good to you. - Dong Soo

617
01:01:52,800 --> 01:01:55,000
I'm going crazy, really!

618
01:02:04,200 --> 01:02:06,200
Lies.

619
01:02:09,600 --> 01:02:11,500
What did you say?

620
01:02:14,900 --> 01:02:17,000
What did you just say?

621
01:02:33,600 --> 01:02:37,400
Lies!

622
01:02:40,610 --> 01:02:42,420
Get lost.

623
01:02:44,200 --> 01:02:47,600
♫ It must be you ♫

624
01:02:47,600 --> 01:02:51,400
♫ I can't be without you ♫

625
01:02:51,400 --> 01:03:01,800
♫ Like this, for another day, month, and year; it's okay, even if I"m hurt ♫

626
01:03:01,800 --> 01:03:05,800
♫ It's okay, even if my heart breaks ♫

627
01:03:05,800 --> 01:03:09,200
♫ Still, I only love you ♫

628
01:03:09,200 --> 01:03:10,600
Is this what you want?
♫Because you're the only one I love ♫

629
01:03:10,600 --> 01:03:13,200
If this is what you want, I'll give it to you.

630
01:03:13,200 --> 01:03:17,200
Go bring the cane! My heart hurts, you punks.

631
01:03:17,230 --> 01:03:18,570
Eun Jo.

632
01:03:18,710 --> 01:03:20,000
Where did you go?

633
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:22,800
I'm sorry for lying.
♫ Is shouting so that I can find you ♫

634
01:03:22,800 --> 01:03:25,800
Good job. Very good job!

635
01:03:25,800 --> 01:03:28,600
How can you be like this... Oppa, don't you know who it is?
♫ Wherever you are ♫

636
01:03:28,600 --> 01:03:31,500
Gi Hoon, can you give me half?

637
01:03:31,500 --> 01:03:33,200
Are you confident you can kill me?

638
01:03:33,200 --> 01:03:34,000
Where are you going?

639
01:03:34,000 --> 01:03:34,800
You said you'd go!

640
01:03:34,800 --> 01:03:36,700
Who said that!
